<title>JAPAN: Hitachi supplies settlement system to NZ Westpac.</title>
<headline>Hitachi supplies settlement system to NZ Westpac.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hitachi Ltd said on Thursday that it has supplied an on-line settlement system to Westpac/Trust of New Zealand for use in trials of the electronic money system Mondex.</p>
<p>The bank started the tests on October 20, a Hitachi spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The order was worth 100 million yen, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The Mondex project has been led by a group of British companies, including National Westminster Bank Plc.</p>
